         measured: p = 3 (from mu_2 ~ 2 sqrt(K) => f' ~ g/a_0);  u ~ r^{(p-n)/(p-1)} = r^0;  grad u ~ r^-1
         The static sector has ONE channel. So the integer n cannot come from a
